Google Dork — site:amazon.com filetype:pdf
A Google search operator used to find specific files on a website.
site: restricts results to a particular domain (example: amazon.com).
filetype: filters results by file format like PDF, DOC, XLS, etc.
Helps in finding public documents, reports, manuals, or leaked files.
Widely used in OSINT, bug bounty, and penetration testing reconnaissance.
